        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok nai Moses alapatu ŋina alokiŋa Eema ŋolo iryamununoi ka Namuroet kiryam, ido kinenek anaŋga lopuke ŋolo ka alapatu a ŋin. Alopite a ŋol, abu Moses kirikak etic daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
