              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todaun Moses epite ŋolo elomarya tooma Eema ŋol, anerae abu edou kimuko Eema ŋol ka abu akica ŋina ke Ekapolon kilelebikin tooma Eema ŋolo iryamununoi. ",
          "type": "text",
